# Subgroup coverage matrices are generated from emitted products (session cache);
# they become CI-lockable only once products are published to S3 (Phase 2b/c).
coverage/*.coverage.yaml
health/health_current.json

# Per-skill standalone product pages (`make atlas-product`) are a rendered VIEW over the committed
# framework_atlas.json — regenerable on demand, no drift guard of their own, so kept out of the tree
# (same rationale as health_current.json). The canonical committed feed is framework_atlas.{json,html}.
health/product/
